From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 08:45:13 +0000
Subject: drm/panthor: report the selected coherency mode

The coherency rework stopped setting gpu_info.selected_coherency.
The GPU info query then reported ACE-Lite in every mode. Report the
selected mode.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: Igor Pecovnik <igor@armbian.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/panthor/panthor_gpu.c | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/panthor/panthor_gpu.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/panthor/panthor_gpu.c
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panthor/panthor_gpu.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panthor/panthor_gpu.c
@@ -491,6 +491,9 @@ int panthor_gpu_coherency_init(struct panthor_device *ptdev)
 		ptdev->coherency_mode = PANTHOR_COHERENCY_ACE_LITE;
 	}
 
+	/* The mode values match the GPU_COHERENCY_* encoding of the uAPI. */
+	ptdev->gpu_info.selected_coherency = ptdev->coherency_mode;
+
 	if (ptdev->coherency_mode == PANTHOR_COHERENCY_NONE)
 		return 0;
 
-- 
